                <div class="__dot"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="side-by-side">
            <div>
                <div class="section-heading__title">
                    <h4>Program Overview</h4>
                </div>

                <p>
                    The Bachelor of Science in Nursing (B.Sc Nursing) is a 4-year undergraduate program designed to
                    prepare
                    students to become qualified nurses as competent, compassionate, and skilled healthcare
                    professionals.
                    The
                    course blends academic excellence with hands-on clinical training to ensure holistic development. It
                    combines theoretical knowledge plus clinical training to provide patient care, promote health, and
                    assist in
                    medical treatments.
                </p>

                <p>
                    B.Sc Nursing is not just a career&mdash;it is a service to humanity with excellent job
                    opportunities,
                    financial
                    stability, and global exposure. It is one of the best career options for students interested in
                    healthcare
                    and patient care.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img src="/images/Lab/Pre Clinical Science Lab.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Pre Clinical Science Lab"
                    loading="lazy">
                <a href="/documents/Admission Form - (BSc. N & PBBSc. N).pdf" target="_blank">
                    <p style="color: blue;text-align: center;font-size: 1.3rem;">
                        Download Admission Form</p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Recognized & approved by -->
            <div class="card full" style="gap: 100px;">
